cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ReSIDS: A Resilient, Adaptive, runtime-Switchable Federated–Gossip IDS"
abstract: >-
  ReSIDS / ereno-Adaptativo is an intrusion-detection system whose nodes switch
  between local, gossip and federated learning at runtime, built on Flower and
  XGBoost. Version 2.1 lets each node decide its learning mode from the trust level
  supplied by the federated failure detector Disaster-FD (API 1.9.0), keeps every
  specialist a node receives in both modes, fuses per-attack specialists by OR, and
  raises alarms per window. It carries the evaluation of the second paper in four
  domains (ERENO, improved CICIDS2017, Morris-4 and CICIoT2023) under pre-registered
  protocols, including the replay of two recorded Disaster-FD runs.
type: software
